    s = s & "" & vbLf
    s = s & "### Running alongside the user's interactive Excel" & vbLf
    s = s & "" & vbLf
    s = s & "The session host spawns its **own** `EXCEL.EXE` process (separate PID" & vbLf
    s = s & "from any Excel the user has open). The two are mostly isolated:" & vbLf
    s = s & "" & vbLf
    s = s & "- ✅ Separate VBA runtime, memory, command bars" & vbLf
    s = s & "- ⚠️  **File locks** — if both processes open the same `.xlsm` read-write, the OS denies the second. Don't open the same workbook in both" & vbLf
